<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile rejects nickel bids.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile rejects nickel bids.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center said it made no nickel award in Thursday's tender.</p>
<p>Seven bids were received from five companies at prices ranging from $3.52870 a pound to $3.5640 a pound.</p>
<p>Bids were for a total of 1,060,000 pounds of nickel.</p>
<p>Nickel will be offered for sale on the second Thursday of each month, the Stockpile Center said.</p>
<p>The next bid opening for nickel is on April 10, 1997.</p>
<p>-New York Commodities Desk, +1-212-859-1640.</p>
